      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe a better solution to add onto this would be the ability for VRChat to dynamically whitelist/blacklist shaders based on community reports.\nMore reports = Shader is investigated by the VRChat time = Blacklist shader if it's bad?\nMaybe this would help with performance from horribly performing shaders. :)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
