  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Occasionally I run across a world or avatar using a VR incompatible shader resulting in double vision or worse. At these times it's unclear how best to report the issue - is it malicious? Not really, the author just didn't have the equipment to test. Poor performance? No, my frame rate is just fine.\n\nPlease add a specific report category, which is exposed to the author if/when action is taken so they know what happened and why.",
